🔍 Program 6 — Search for a Word in a File

📌 Description

This program demonstrates how to search for a specific word inside a text file and count how many times the word occurs.

The program reads whitespace-separated words from the file and compares them with the target word.

🔑 Concepts Covered

- 🔎 Searching file contents
- 📖 Reading words using "ifstream"
- 🔢 Counting word occurrences
- 🧵 String comparison
- 📂 Text-file processing

📁 File Used

"message.txt"

🧠 Main C++ Feature

Stream extraction using "operator >>"
